# Mirrorweave targets Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla: every other creature on the battlefield, either player's, becomes a copy of it
# until end of turn (CR 707.2, 611.2c) - Bot1's Llanowar Elves, Ornithopter and Bofur, and Bot2's Llanowar Elves are each a
# 2/2 green Guerrilla Gorilla with reach. Ornithopter is no longer an artifact, and Bofur, copying a nonlegendary creature, is
# no longer legendary: copiable values are the whole of what it is (CR 707.2, 613.2a). The Gorilla itself is untouched. Bofur,
# legendary, can't be the target (the refusal; the cast at the Gorilla is its control). As the turn ends each is what it was
# (CR 514.2): on turn 5 they are themselves again.

